      "message": "It is done there. But, it\u0027s also done here, so that we give the right error message. Because without the permission, running virtmgr will fail.\n\n@seungjaeyoo@google.com Can we have a comment to that effect? (Putting permission checks on the client side is a common security blunder, so we should make it clear this is intentional.)",
