      "writtenOn": "2024-04-09T01:20:48Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u003e This code runs in the app process. The permission check should be done on the server side (in this case virtmngr or virtualizationservice?)\n\nLet me explain what I understood so far. After giving `CAP_SYS_NICE` to virtmgr, app without `MANAGE_VIRTUAL_MACHINE` permission loses ability to connect with virtmgr. And the GID associated with `MANAGE_VIRTUAL_MACHINE` newly get `CAP_SYS_NICE`, so app with `MANAGE_VIRTUAL_MACHINE` can connect with virtmgr.\n\nFor the above reason, doing the permission check in client side instead, to make error more descriptive.\n\n\u003e BTW we have the permission name available as a constant - VirtualMachine.MANAGE_VIRTUAL_MACHINE_PERMISSION.\n\nAh! Will do that.",
      "parentUuid": "6aaab6b9_7bc63a1b",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 66,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 69,
